copyright (c) 2023 Axel Adrian, MIT licensed. The fork keeps the components and
their styling, and changes how they are distributed: shadcn-templ copies sources
into your repository with a CLI, templ-ui is imported as a Go module.

shadcn-templ is itself a port of shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com), copyright
(c) 2023 shadcn, MIT licensed. The style sheets under assets/css/styles are
vendored from that project, as are tw-animate-css and the typeset styles noted
in assets/css/globals.css.

Neither project is affiliated with this fork.
